DTSTAMP:20260827T094105Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260827
SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Page updated: Maine Judicial Branch Court Ale
 rts & Closings
DESCRIPTION:This page's content changed since the last check. Visit the pa
 ge directly to review the update.\n\nWhat changed (text excerpt):\nAdded:\
 n  + Cumberland County Superior Court and Unified Criminal Docket - Portla
 nd\n  + In preparation for the launch of Maine eCourts and eFiling in Regi
 on 2 courts\, the Cumberland County Superior Court and UCD will be closed 
 all day to the public beginning Monday\, September 21st through Friday\, S
 eptember 25th. Monday\, September 28th through Friday\, October 2nd\, the 
 court will be closed in the mornings\, from 8am to noon.\n  + Please see t
 he\n  + Region 2 Maine eCourts Deployment notice\n  + for more information
  and instructions on how to submit an emergency filing when the court is c
 losed.\n  + Bridgton District Court\n  + In preparation for the launch of 
 Maine eCourts and eFiling in Region 2 courts\, the Bridgton District Court
  will be closed all day to the public beginning Tuesday\, September 15th t
 hrough Friday\, September 25th. Monday\, September 28th through Friday\, O
 ctober 2nd\, the court will be closed in the mornings\, from 8am to noon.\
 n  + Please see the\n  + Region 2 Maine eCourts Deployment notice\n  + for
  more information and instructions on how to submit an emergency filing wh
 en the court is closed.\n  + Calais District Court\n  + Thursday\, August 
 27\, 2026\, the Calais District Court building will be closed all day. Hea
 rings conducted remotely by ZOOM will go on as scheduled and the clerk's o
 ffice will be available by phone during normal business hours.\n  + Portla
 nd District Court\n  + In preparation for the launch of Maine eCourts and 
 eFiling in Region 2 courts\, the Portland Dis\n[diff truncated]\nhttps://w
 ww.courts.maine.gov/courts/alerts.shtml
URL:https://www.courts.maine.gov/courts/alerts.shtml
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
